title: MrSnowman
---
Mr. Snowman: ...
Mr. Snowman: .....
Mr. Snowman: Hello! I'm Mr. Snowman!
Mr. Snowman: .....
Mr. Snowman: I haven't had the pleasure of speaking to someone in years!
Mr. Snowman: I must inquire with you...
Mr. Snowman: Is it a little warm in here or is that just me?
-> Now that you mention it...
    Mr. Snowman: I fear for my safety, friend.
    Mr. Snowman: For each year is warmer than the last.
    Mr. Snowman: How many more will pass 'till I am simply a puddle on this mountain?
    <<assign-quest allTheStickers>>
-> Nah I don't think so
    Mr. Snowman: Ah, apologies.
===

title: Employee
---
Employee: Hello! Skier! 
Employee: Have you been informed about the company yet?
-> Yea...
    Employee: Fantastic!
-> No?
    Employee: You should be sure to familiarize yourself.
    Employee: We're in the process of acquiring this mountain.
    -> Acquire the mountain??
        Employee: Yes! The mountain will be so much better afterwards.
        Employee: I mean lift tickets might get more expensive, but that's not important-
        Employee: If you dont mind, can you fill out this form for me?
        Employee: If you fill it out, Im one step closer to that promotion!
        -> Hell no!
            Employee: Uh ok... Rude.
        -> Uh, sure.
            Employee: Thank you!
